WEBVTT

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:05.910
You left me behind, and died.

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:10.940
That's right. My Haruka is dead.

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:15.890
She died right in front of me in the summer when we were 17.

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:18.200
Haruka!

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:21.140
Kaminogi! Yuu!

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:22.600
Come on out!

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:25.100
Haruka, where are you?

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:26.280
Ai...

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:28.840
Everyone, you can't be here!

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:31.590
I heard her! I heard her voice!

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:33.840
Where are you?! Haruka!

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.150
We've come to get you!

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:37.870
Let's all go home together, Haruka!

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:39.680
I can't, Ai...

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:20.870
What is that?

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:23.140
It's not a rainbow, is it?

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:25.200
The Ouroboros.

00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:28.440
This is bad. I sense major trouble.

00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:30.990
What's wrong, Atori?

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:33.190
You lot, get inside the house.

00:02:33.220 --> 00:02:33.720
Huh?

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.780
How come?! We're...

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:37.960
Shut up! I told you to get inside, so get inside!

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:41.220
This dimension is an illusion to you.

00:02:41.670 --> 00:02:43.240
It's an impossible world.

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:47.680
The only thing that's real to you in this dimension is that house.

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:49.990
But what about Haruka and Goto?

00:02:50.030 --> 00:02:52.750
That's right! We can't abandon our friends in a place like this!

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:56.990
Stop nitpicking! You kids are still too young to understand this!

00:02:57.050 --> 00:02:57.840
Atori!

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:02.970
We can't leave our friends behind
and only save ourselves, Atori.

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:05.700
Run, Ai.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:12.190
Ai... run for it.

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:14.700
They'll get you.

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:16.880
Idiot. I can't just leave you!

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:16.900
Run for it, Ai.
Idiot. I can't just leave you!

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:18.970
Run for it, Ai.

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:24.270
We all promised we'd run away to the South together.

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:28.330
If we all head south, we won't have to freeze to death any more.

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:31.650
No adults will pick on us ever again.

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:35.140
We can live all by ourselves, remember, Jill?!

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:57.940
Sheesh... You guys gotta knock it off.

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:03.320
I promise I'll find them.

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:07.350
Send them back! Send everyone back!

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:17.990
Ow, ow, ow...

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:19.290
Y-You okay?

00:04:19.330 --> 00:04:21.630
Yeah. But what was that?

00:04:21.670 --> 00:04:23.010
It wasn't an earthquake, right?

00:04:23.810 --> 00:04:24.950
Atori...

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:28.010
It's Haruka.

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:31.930
Amazing. That's amazing, Haruka.

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:33.770
You're the best.

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:37.250
I hate you! I'll never trust you!

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:40.440
You and I will become one.

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:41.650
What?

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:44.740
To erase my sorrow,

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:47.240
I need you.

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:50.540
I see something in the sky!

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:51.620
Impossible...

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:54.750
This is really bad.

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:57.170
Are the dimensions converging?

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:03.360
It must be Haruka.

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:07.950
The dimensional convergence has begun.

00:05:07.980 --> 00:05:09.370
Dimensional convergence?

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:12.730
Noein is beginning to use Haruka's power.

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:14.140
Haruka's power?

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:16.120
We must hurry.

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:16.140
Is Haruka...?
We must hurry.

00:05:16.140 --> 00:05:17.510
Is Haruka...?

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:36.510
Karasu, look!

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:38.100
It's starting.

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:40.360
Yuu, don't be afraid of them.

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:43.270
Think only of Haruka. Do that,

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:47.150
and the path to her will open.

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:50.890
Let go of me! I have to help Yuu!

00:05:52.890 --> 00:05:53.980
Dammit!

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:54.720
Fujiwara!

00:05:55.230 --> 00:05:57.730
Haruka is trying to send you all back.

00:05:57.910 --> 00:05:58.760
She is?

00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:00.730
But we can't just leave them here!

00:06:01.610 --> 00:06:04.230
I swear I will bring them back.

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:05.940
I'm staying behind!

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:08.130
Jeez!

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:10.490
Trust me a little bit...

00:06:10.940 --> 00:06:11.870
Atori.

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:15.200
I hope you find your little sister.

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:21.690
My sister died a long time ago.

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:22.650
Huh?

00:06:24.490 --> 00:06:26.760
She stepped on a land mine and got blown to pieces.

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:28.730
Pretty stupid, huh?

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:31.670
Don't you guys make the same stupid mistake.

00:06:32.770 --> 00:06:33.620
See ya.

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:35.160
Wait!

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:37.960
Will I see you again?

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:40.980
I can't predict the future.

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:47.920
But isn't the future interesting 'cause
we don't know what happens next?

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:52.390
Play nice now.

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:09.320
Well now...

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:12.660
I guess I'll have to search for that unhappy looking loser.

00:07:16.840 --> 00:07:18.540
You sent them home?

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:22.380
But I was going to integrate them into this dimension.

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:26.360
You always bring me nothing but grief.

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:28.110
I do?

00:07:28.330 --> 00:07:30.680
<i>You</i> in every dimension...

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:34.090
always bring <i>Me</i> in every dimension
nothing but sorrow.

00:07:37.170 --> 00:07:38.330
They're coming!

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:43.170
They're landing, Karasu!

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:44.540
They're trying to surround us.

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:57.680
They're...

00:08:14.100 --> 00:08:17.270
What is that?! It's getting bigger!

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:19.470
They are reacting to us.

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:21.830
To us?!

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:23.960
It is Noein's will.

00:08:24.760 --> 00:08:27.590
Because we're trying to save Haruka, right?

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:37.260
I'll take care of them, you go after Haruka!

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:38.720
Me?

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:40.930
You can do it.

00:08:45.700 --> 00:08:47.610
Position fixed on vessels 1 through 6.

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:49.630
Start countdown from 20.

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:51.670
Firing device, ready.

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:53.330
Acceleration coil, ready.

00:08:53.610 --> 00:08:55.000
Commence countdown.

00:08:55.390 --> 00:08:56.590
Deploy radiator panels.

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:13.510
Just do it already.

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:31.020
All vessels are linked.

00:09:32.350 --> 00:09:35.650
Now, we have taken the first step to history!

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:38.270
Can you understand my sheer excitement?!

00:09:40.460 --> 00:09:42.790
Let's dance, Mayuzumi-chan.

00:09:48.840 --> 00:09:49.500
What's wrong?

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:52.400
Don't worry about it, go on without us!

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:56.510
We can't go any further.

00:09:56.770 --> 00:09:57.530
But why?

00:09:58.010 --> 00:10:00.260
Our existences are starting to be erased

00:10:00.260 --> 00:10:02.600
by the wavering of the quanta in the Magic Circle.

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:06.300
So please go without us.

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:07.920
C'mon, let's move!

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:14.530
Let's trust them to finish the job.

00:11:27.860 --> 00:11:29.660
What is this thing?

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:32.860
We committed a blunder.

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:34.810
What do you mean?

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:37.940
I'm looking for Haruka.

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:43.180
Do you know how I can get to her?

00:11:44.480 --> 00:11:47.170
Can you stop Noein?

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:50.210
I don't know that for sure...

00:11:51.950 --> 00:11:53.460
But I'm going to save Haruka!

00:11:54.260 --> 00:11:58.250
If so, I will deliver you to the gathering space.

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:05.660
See? It's gone.

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:08.470
Miyuki, it's really gone.

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:10.440
And Haruka's gone, too...

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:12.210
Asuka, calm down!

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:12.860
And Haruka's gone, too...

00:12:16.510 --> 00:12:18.440
Blue snow?

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:19.000
Huh?

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:25.720
The house...

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:28.370
The house reappeared!

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:31.580
Atori!

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:34.890
Mukai?! Huh? It's back to normal. Impossible...

00:12:34.930 --> 00:12:36.900
Really? Is it okay?

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:38.710
You lot, what happened?!

00:12:38.710 --> 00:12:39.980
Where did you all go?!

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:42.120
Where is Yuu?

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:44.010
Are Yuu and Haruka-chan with you?!

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:45.680
Err...

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:48.990
Will you believe us, ma'am? Haruka is...

00:12:50.510 --> 00:12:53.420
Kaminogi-san! I heard that your house disappeared!

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:56.910
But it's here...

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:08.180
Quantity acceleration 65 percent.

00:13:08.610 --> 00:13:11.520
It will reach critical mass in 13 minutes, 40 seconds.

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:18.070
Spin! Spin! Spin for me baby!

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:24.920
You know this dimension was formed

00:13:24.920 --> 00:13:28.050
by the accumulation of all sorrows.

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:31.310
That is why people had obliterated their existences.

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:35.540
The existence of people leads to sorrow.

00:13:36.190 --> 00:13:39.560
Recognition can also be the beginning of misunderstanding.

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:44.760
That is why... people had stopped recognizing,

00:13:45.210 --> 00:13:47.410
obliterated their individual existences,

00:13:48.400 --> 00:13:50.700
and became a collective form.

00:13:56.490 --> 00:13:57.210
Yuu!

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:00.460
Haruka!

00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:02.960
Let Haruka go.

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:06.470
Oh, so you invited him as well.

00:14:07.090 --> 00:14:09.220
All right then, I shall show you.

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:12.640
Come, Haruka...

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:15.390
Dragon Torque...

00:14:16.030 --> 00:14:19.020
There is no need to choose a future.

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:23.280
All dimensions will become one,

00:14:23.280 --> 00:14:25.030
and expire.

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:26.550
Run, Haruka!

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:31.280
Shut this down, now!

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:34.790
The surrounding quanta will resonate and begin destruction!

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:38.510
I made sure to compensate the local fishermen.

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:39.850
You think it's funny!?

00:14:39.890 --> 00:14:40.910
Nobody move!

00:14:44.260 --> 00:14:45.220
Don't move now...

00:14:45.270 --> 00:14:47.300
Professor Mayuzumi, shut down the system.

00:14:47.670 --> 00:14:49.420
Heh, what a cheap gun.

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:50.300
Shut up!

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:52.810
If you're gonna pack heat, this is the way to go!

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:55.610
Although I suppose small budget public workers

00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:57.500
can't afford something like this...

00:14:57.790 --> 00:14:59.670
I'll arrest you for possession of an illegal weapon...

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:00.700
Shut up!

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:04.070
Listen. Can't you hear it?

00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:07.550
It's the quickening of a new era.

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:12.530
8 minutes, 30 seconds until critical mass.

00:15:14.050 --> 00:15:15.460
What is that...

00:15:20.050 --> 00:15:22.540
What is that?! Something is rising up.

00:15:23.030 --> 00:15:24.290
It's the Ouroboros!

00:15:33.340 --> 00:15:34.830
It's fading...

00:15:35.020 --> 00:15:36.410
It's all...

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:39.680
fading away.

00:15:40.610 --> 00:15:41.520
Enra!

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:48.170
The final barrier limes... are collapsing.

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:58.720
Oops, I think I hit him.

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:00.490
Oh, well. It was self-defense.

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:01.780
Kooriyama-san!

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:03.170
Don't make a fuss!

00:16:03.430 --> 00:16:04.190
You bastard...

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:06.000
I told you I wouldn't let you interfere.

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:07.670
Stop it! Stop it, please!

00:16:07.890 --> 00:16:08.670
Why, you...

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:17.390
Shinohara-kun, I'm doing this to benefit the future of mankind!

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:19.870
Not to hurt people!

00:16:20.180 --> 00:16:20.950
So what?

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:24.880
Professor Mayuzumi.

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:24.900
Did you seriously think that I was oblivious to your plan?
Professor Mayuzumi.

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:28.000
Did you seriously think that I was oblivious to your plan?

00:16:28.730 --> 00:16:31.050
Even I could tell that you took down our security,

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:33.550
to get these guys inside!

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.780
Stay right there and watch!

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:36.820
Look out!

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:44.230
Damned filth. Don't interfere.

00:16:47.070 --> 00:16:49.430
Are you going to oppose me?

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:53.070
I won't let you beat me!

00:16:59.270 --> 00:17:03.570
Only one Goto Yuu in all dimensions,

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:06.510
is all that we need.

00:17:10.150 --> 00:17:11.040
Yuu!

00:17:13.320 --> 00:17:16.200
I love to hate you.

00:17:16.230 --> 00:17:16.910
Stop it!

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:34.910
Karasu...

00:17:36.430 --> 00:17:39.450
Yes. I am you.

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:43.570
Oh, if I could only go back and do it all over...

00:17:44.240 --> 00:17:46.950
I would go back to when I was a boy like you.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:48.190
Don't be stupid!

00:17:49.110 --> 00:17:52.010
Your eyes are still pure and untainted.

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:54.740
It makes me sad to think

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:58.870
that those eyes will become so deeply etched with sorrow.

00:17:58.990 --> 00:18:00.200
What're you talking about?!

00:18:00.650 --> 00:18:04.240
You will eventually experience a great sadness.

00:18:05.860 --> 00:18:08.700
A sadness so profound, you will believe you lead a cursed life.

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:10.460
I refuse to believe you!

00:18:10.930 --> 00:18:11.660
Haruka!

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:13.460
I refuse to believe in you!

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:18.590
Very well then, I will show you.

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:19.990
Huh?

00:18:27.680 --> 00:18:29.840
All of you sure have matured.

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:32.340
Of course we have. We're 17 now!

00:18:32.890 --> 00:18:35.440
I guess it's been five years since you graduated from elementary school.

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:38.250
You haven't changed a bit in five years, Sensei.

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:42.440
Thanks, Goto-kun. I see you've learned to use flattery.

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:43.250
Yuu!

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:45.690
It's cramped back here.

00:18:45.730 --> 00:18:48.260
You should have been more thoughtful.

00:18:48.300 --> 00:18:49.100
Who, me?

00:18:49.140 --> 00:18:53.210
Yeah, you. Goto hasn't been back from Tokyo in ages,

00:18:53.510 --> 00:18:56.090
so you could've let him sit next to Haruka.

00:18:56.840 --> 00:18:58.110
Cut it out.

00:18:58.110 --> 00:18:59.300
Yeah.

00:18:59.810 --> 00:19:02.210
Now I feel really bad about it.

00:19:02.210 --> 00:19:03.830
Sensei, drive faster!

00:19:04.550 --> 00:19:06.730
We'll be there in the blink of an eye with your driving skills.

00:19:06.760 --> 00:19:09.480
Sorry, I'm already going fast enough.

00:19:13.900 --> 00:19:15.890
It's a shame Miho couldn't make it.

00:19:15.930 --> 00:19:18.880
She had to a family wedding to attend.

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:20.460
So, have we decided what to get at the store?

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:46.850
Yuu... Yuu...

00:19:47.360 --> 00:19:50.190
Yuu... Help me...

00:19:50.780 --> 00:19:51.520
Haruka?!

00:19:57.570 --> 00:20:01.490
In an instant, I lost all of my friends,

00:20:01.490 --> 00:20:03.880
and you, the one I loved.

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:06.840
Can you understand the sorrow?

00:20:07.400 --> 00:20:11.110
The sorrow of the one who is left behind?

00:20:12.500 --> 00:20:15.750
I experienced a moment where the world...

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:18.560
ceased to have meaning.

00:20:20.390 --> 00:20:21.840
Haruka...

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:27.170
Why? Why did you disappear from me?

00:20:28.270 --> 00:20:30.400
Leaving me all alone...

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:33.980
Why?

00:20:40.950 --> 00:20:42.470
Why?

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:46.850
Why must I take all this suffering?

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:51.850
I wandered through infinite dimensions in search of you.

00:20:52.650 --> 00:20:54.750
In search of my Haruka.

00:20:56.170 --> 00:20:59.650
But then... I realized.

00:21:00.510 --> 00:21:03.070
I realized that in the infinity of dimensions,

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:06.670
there is nothing but an infinity of pain and sorrow.

00:21:08.210 --> 00:21:10.660
Everywhere there was death.

00:21:11.210 --> 00:21:15.370
Everywhere there was pain steeped in sorrow.

00:21:15.720 --> 00:21:17.730
Yuu, help me!

00:21:17.770 --> 00:21:18.580
Haruka!

00:21:18.620 --> 00:21:20.650
Yuu, help me!

00:21:20.690 --> 00:21:21.460
Haruka!

00:21:21.490 --> 00:21:23.260
Yuu, help me!

00:21:23.290 --> 00:21:24.450
Haruka!

00:21:28.560 --> 00:21:33.400
People do not simply just exist in this dimension.

00:21:34.300 --> 00:21:38.620
By people recognizing the dimension they seek,

00:21:38.620 --> 00:21:40.830
that dimension gains existence.

00:21:41.830 --> 00:21:46.680
The ultimate observer is each and every human being.

00:21:47.210 --> 00:21:49.390
That is why I lost hope.

00:21:50.350 --> 00:21:53.810
All the dimensions cannot escape the chain of unhappiness.

00:21:55.090 --> 00:21:57.370
It started out all wrong.

00:21:58.290 --> 00:22:01.730
That is why I will integrate the dimensions into Shangri-la...

00:22:02.830 --> 00:22:04.400
to return all to nothingness.

00:22:06.200 --> 00:22:07.840
If we return all to nothingness,

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:12.470
the dimension will be reborn again from the beginning and branch off,

00:22:12.470 --> 00:22:14.410
giving birth to a new universe.

00:22:15.660 --> 00:22:18.920
I'm sure that a good dimension will be born this time.

00:22:22.150 --> 00:22:24.950
Come. Come to me.

00:22:26.250 --> 00:22:29.750
To release the people from every kind of suffering.

00:22:30.820 --> 00:22:34.160
From the nothingness, let's bring a new dimension into the world.

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:37.750
I hold the future in my hands.

00:22:41.440 --> 00:22:42.980
10 seconds until critical mass.

00:22:45.540 --> 00:22:46.480
That's...

00:22:47.510 --> 00:22:48.740
Come...

00:22:58.850 --> 00:23:00.280
Come...

00:23:02.090 --> 00:23:03.210
Haruka!

00:23:03.210 --> 00:23:06.930
Because you no longer have a future.

00:24:42.260 --> 00:24:44.230
I'm dreaming again.

00:24:45.260 --> 00:24:46.760
That summer day's dream.

00:24:47.540 --> 00:24:49.170
Dragon Torque...

00:24:49.480 --> 00:24:51.400
Come with me to a world of nothingness.

00:24:55.370 --> 00:24:57.410
Haruka!

00:25:03.880 --> 00:25:06.290
Next episode, The Beginning

00:25:07.050 --> 00:25:09.880
Please deliver everybody's wishes.
